        <item>
            <title>1.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:40:15 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>115</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Darkbloom Control v1.4.0

- Replace the model list with responsive, branded cards showing measured speed,
  live demand, average net profit per active hour, local opportunity grade, and
  catalog hardware fit.
- Add per-model daily compute-allocation scenarios with a shared 24-hour budget.
  Projections extrapolate from measured serving activity and clearly separate
  estimated gross payout from incremental whole-Mac adapter power cost.
- Require at least two hours of observed active serving before showing a
  model's profit projection; serving allocation estimates compute time and is
  separate from the number of models resident in memory.
]]></description>
